> Wow, you make him sound like Lugh :)

Tsss. The trash the Master of Thieves throws at my characters is
really annoying. What a deity gives me is _at worst_ useless (because
i know how to avoid the really ugly stuff fairly reliably), but most
of the time very helpful or even life-saving. I won't desert a NetHack
deity unless this course of action really fits my character plan. And
i'm way too unfamiliar with celtic myth to have any sort of real
opinion on Lugh, although Bridget might be an attractive choice for
conversion - except that her guaranteed altar is no longer available
once you're converted ...

